{
  "sampleRate": 22050,
  "voice": "Microsoft Huihui Desktop",
  "version": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "sha256": "4541d48928915e3b33b66c0378d8e04f04b0141713978c6966e409dcdaec403d",
      "id": "home",
      "bytes": 64487,
      "text": "你好！点绿色大三角，就能开始。也可以点大图片，选一个想玩的地方。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/4541d48928915e3b33b66c03.mp3",
      "duration": 10.636327
    },
    {
      "sha256": "91f89d82733114d0bb9bb7d277191475fcc9cee91c5a35ee69289b55b38971aa",
      "id": "map",
      "bytes": 36745,
      "text": "点一个小岛，再点大三角，就能打开小课。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/91f89d82733114d0bb9bb7d2.mp3",
      "duration": 6.028027
    },
    {
      "sha256": "ccd0867af5d68eec26219e4097c79d8a3aa5b97111bbd38ef5e89685c10b7419",
      "id": "words",
      "bytes": 54142,
      "text": "点绿色大三角，玩五道单词题。想换主题，点下面的小卡片。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/ccd0867af5d68eec26219e40.mp3",
      "duration": 8.91678
    },
    {
      "sha256": "6af49979cec33b1c7f44edb1948b3ef43275ac367556646cf0791b8ad0370043",
      "id": "topics",
      "bytes": 48500,
      "text": "先选一张图片，再挑一个小任务。点大三角，开始玩。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/6af49979cec33b1c7f44edb1.mp3",
      "duration": 7.983039
    },
    {
      "sha256": "7c3c873b495ad0870dfa7553ca23c89bee4edaaee0aee1ca7779b995debc4bdd",
      "id": "patterns",
      "bytes": 40820,
      "text": "选一个你想说的话题，再点大三角，试着说一句。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/7c3c873b495ad0870dfa7553.mp3",
      "duration": 6.689478
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9efc9483af9450aa4c476276ed6cbf1f4a988e0672b6b72d973e964ef6d40a99",
      "id": "review",
      "bytes": 55396,
      "text": "像给小花浇水一样，想一想学过的内容。做一点点，就可以休息。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/9efc9483af9450aa4c476276.mp3",
      "duration": 9.12195
    },
    {
      "sha256": "823f9c4e6e92f09084dd5ce91befc4eecb6c3485d4dbbfefa49a6c12dfb785d1",
      "id": "lesson",
      "bytes": 65271,
      "text": "点喇叭，听一句。用两边的箭头翻卡片。准备好了，点大三角，试一试。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/823f9c4e6e92f09084dd5ce9.mp3",
      "duration": 10.787574
    },
    {
      "sha256": "4712b79d73b5bbfa3f49ac86def2b64946e208389ef453b776f42b82d6d9d1e8",
      "id": "choice",
      "bytes": 76556,
      "text": "先听题目，或者看看题目。选好一个答案以后，点绿色大勾。小喇叭可以帮你读中文选项。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/4712b79d73b5bbfa3f49ac86.mp3",
      "duration": 12.650159
    },
    {
      "sha256": "a27494a4bfc30aaf28a63ffa03b1a88c128b3275121bbb7da77b5cdb9786c709",
      "id": "input",
      "bytes": 41760,
      "text": "在空格里写下你的答案。写好了，点绿色大勾。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/a27494a4bfc30aaf28a63ffa.mp3",
      "duration": 6.857551
    },
    {
      "sha256": "bbb03ec217765c72c8119c5bf593de9d9eb4d8d044f802a78892b590a2aa0ac4",
      "id": "order",
      "bytes": 72010,
      "text": "点小词块，把它们排好。点已经放好的词块，可以拿回来。排好了，点绿色大勾。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/bbb03ec217765c72c8119c5b.mp3",
      "duration": 11.902766
    },
    {
      "sha256": "9281c9322ca23c96ecb14f7b0b54675389aacba30ccb657893533aa8d1ad21c2",
      "id": "sort",
      "bytes": 51008,
      "text": "先选一张卡片，再点一个篮子。都放好以后，点绿色大勾。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/9281c9322ca23c96ecb14f7b.mp3",
      "duration": 8.392789
    },
    {
      "sha256": "0ec3adbfb21fdbaffcba4a43acde40943c081220238ee591df73b74298c51024",
      "id": "repair",
      "bytes": 61509,
      "text": "找到需要修改的地方，点一下，再写下你的改法。完成以后，点绿色大勾。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/0ec3adbfb21fdbaffcba4a43.mp3",
      "duration": 10.152517
    },
    {
      "sha256": "c9ea19feb531d47eaae5aa8d85f84b36ea1277da71d5c57c39f29db9019930e5",
      "id": "evidence",
      "bytes": 55396,
      "text": "先读小故事，再选答案，找一条线索。选好了，点绿色大勾。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/c9ea19feb531d47eaae5aa8d.mp3",
      "duration": 9.142585
    },
    {
      "sha256": "cdb0288749078a472d87fb3c8ae5adc0173eb304e02a8260cbbf8c48b0a82351",
      "id": "saved",
      "bytes": 39566,
      "text": "已经保存好啦！点大箭头，继续下一小步。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/cdb0288749078a472d87fb3c.mp3",
      "duration": 6.492925
    },
    {
      "sha256": "8aff54afdc0f19e4a1e892250e229555832beaa25a852410af3789b6fd2d1d66",
      "id": "parent",
      "bytes": 59785,
      "text": "请家长来帮你登录，再选一位小探险家。选好以后，就能保存学习进度。",
      "url": "/audio/guides/8aff54afdc0f19e4a1e89225.mp3",
      "duration": 9.868617
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "sha256": "a07fdfda84774c736a512ed5c6ea3af709713e6f2bb8d6d3854b4310349cc1e0",
      "bytes": 62920,
      "url": "/audio/guides/a07fdfda84774c736a512ed5.mp3",
      "text": "准备好了，就点绿色大三角。不会的地方，可以点小灯泡，请伙伴帮帮忙。",
      "duration": 10.396599
    },
    {
      "url": "/audio/guides/4b0353e4c77cfae01d258a3b.mp3",
      "sha256": "4b0353e4c77cfae01d258a3bdc55e72748706afe72057530b94e92200e621bf1",
      "duration": 12.974785,
      "bytes": 78436,
      "id": "phonics",
      "text": "先点一条小路。听一听单词，再点字母积木，看看它们怎样合起来。准备好了，点大三角。"
    },
    {
      "url": "/audio/guides/21c576a1e99fc4c2094e87be.mp3",
      "sha256": "21c576a1e99fc4c2094e87bee5d0d5e7fb368cf11606142fdf5c6d77311bebce",
      "duration": 11.109206,
      "bytes": 67308,
      "id": "workshops",
      "text": "选一个想玩的工坊，点卡片开始。分类时，把同一类的卡片，放进同一个篮子。"
    },
    {
      "url": "/audio/guides/46f80143e53ec501050a2fd0.mp3",
      "sha256": "46f80143e53ec501050a2fd0216ea66648e516ee4cd4dec297a384fe08520534",
      "duration": 12.595828,
      "bytes": 76242,
      "id": "writing",
      "text": "点大空格，写下自己的小作品。点保存，才会留下来。想离开时，可以请家长帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "url": "/audio/guides/90de062eca8363dd3ecc2708.mp3",
      "sha256": "90de062eca8363dd3ecc2708c3faf9385151ba81796b34e9f1e0b60a3e3c3f17",
      "duration": 12.064127,
      "bytes": 72951,
      "id": "mistakes",
      "text": "这里放着可以再想一想的题目。点一张小卡，看看上次怎么答。点小喇叭，听一听讲解。"
    },
    {
      "url": "/audio/guides/ee766437ec4816a45a74b91d.mp3",
      "sha256": "ee766437ec4816a45a74b91d90d3196d8b340915c9f0754889432a6398c5545f",
      "duration": 12.100726,
      "bytes": 73264,
      "id": "offline",
      "text": "先请家长帮你准备好本机练习。准备好了，就可以接着玩。联网以后，再确认保存。"
    },
    {
      "url": "/audio/guides/067215ae3d5cefd4e842ff1c.mp3",
      "sha256": "067215ae3d5cefd4e842ff1ca969b54a2d3d510e4d46381f13386539e2bbc540",
      "duration": 11.738685,
      "bytes": 71070,
      "id": "talk",
      "text": "点一个角色，再点开始。可以说一句，也可以打字。语音功能需要先由家长开启。"
    }
  ],
  "channels": 1,
  "kind": "synthetic-navigation-only",
  "format": "mp3",
  "bitRate": 48000
}
